OL,3,GNEWSAEmpty former city nightclub hit by
OL,4,Ablaze
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters have worked through the
OL,7,Fnight to deal with a fire at a former
OL,8,Fnightclub in Stoke-on-Trent.
OL,10,FThey were called to the disused
OL,11,Ffour-storey property on Trinity Street
OL,12,Fin Hanley at 19:10 BST on Thursday and
OL,13,Fsealed off the surrounding area.
OL,15,FThe crews remained at the scene
OL,16,Fovernight to dampen down hot spots and
OL,17,Fto make sure the building was safe.
OL,19,FAn investigation is under way into the
OL,20,Fcause of the fire at the building,
OL,21,Fwhich was once home to Groove Castle.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
